    "/api/v2/items/aggregate/": {
      "post": {
        "operationId": "Aggregate_2",
        "description": "Aggregate a queryset based on a provided field and operation.\n\nNote: This method currently requires the EntitySearchMixin to be a parent class. The goal is to move that functionality into this\nclass and retire the mixin, but that requires a bit of refactoring.\n\nTODO:\n* Need to address possibility of mappings not existing for a given index/catch errors there",
