      "AssetAssociationRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Serializer to associate Assets with an Entity.\n\nThis serializer handles:\n1. Asset association with entities\n2. Property management (e.g., 'photograph' property)\n3. Property transfer between assets (only one asset can have a specific property)\n\nWhen associating assets with properties:\n- If an asset is associated with a property that another asset already has,\n  the property will be removed from the existing asset and set on the new one\n- Multiple assets can be associated without properties\n- Properties can be updated on existing associations\n\nThe entire operation is atomic - either all associations are created/updated, or none are.",
        "properties": {
          "assets": {
            "type": "array",
