      "PatchedMaterialRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "This serializer allows for materials to be attached to child_materials recursively.\nThe validation is performed at the serializer level, as such, there is potential for a cyclical reference if Models are persisted via a different means.\nIdeally, we would have some constraint on the DB to prevent a cyclical reference\nTODO: Find a better way to retrieve child materials recursively in a single DB Query\nTODO: Find a better way to prevent cyclical references",
